259	// TestConcurrentPublishRollbackSameVersionContention runs the two operations
260	// as a genuine concurrent race: both goroutines are released from one barrier
261	// while declaring the same expected current version. The mutex decides the
262	// winner; regardless of which side wins, exactly one change is accepted and
